T: Jesse James (lute solo) [v.1 by Cranberry] (4:33)
N: "Jesse James", author unknown. Traditional bluegrass song. Possibly recorded by the Kingston Trio in 1961.
N: Song adapted to LotRO by Cranberry of Landroval, Mighty Mighty Bree Tones kinship.
